# Relámpago (20): de noche con tormenta, un rayo a 20 bloques delante; capturas antes y durante el destello.
close
command weather thunder
command gamerule advance_time false
time 18000
command tp @s 170.5 110 150.5 0 10
sleep 6
screenshot relampago-antes
command summon minecraft:lightning_bolt 170 110 175
sleep 0.4
screenshot relampago-04
command summon minecraft:lightning_bolt 170 110 175
sleep 0.7
screenshot relampago-07
command weather clear
